Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:01.60,0:00:04.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人世謂緣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:05.10,0:00:07.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,繫結的絲線糾結纏繞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:07.40,0:00:09.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脆弱可悲的彼岸花
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:10.00,0:00:13.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在憤怒 悲傷 淚已盡中度日
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:14.50,0:00:16.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,午夜零點的帷幕彼方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:17.20,0:00:20.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,難消之恨 願爲消之
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:23.80,0:00:28.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}いつか{\K80}光{\K40}に向{\K40}か{\K60}う　{\K60\K30}逆{\K90}さまの{\K60}蝶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:29.00,0:00:33.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}君{\K20}と{\K40}髪{\K50}を{\K30}切{\K60}る　{\K30\K80}鏡{\K40}の{\K100}中
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:34.20,0:00:39.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K60}授業{\K50}中{\K60}の{\K80}廊下　{\K80\K40}響{\K40}く{\K100}足音
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:39.90,0:00:45.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}絶{\K20}えず{\K30}雨{\K40}の{\K60}音{\K60}が　{\K20\K40}つい{\K50}て{\K40\K40}くる{\K50}よ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:45.30,0:00:50.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}感{\K30}じ{\K45}る{\K45}まま{\K30}の{\K70\K60}形{\K40}は{\K60}眩{\K60}しい
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:50.50,0:00:55.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}甘{\K30}い{\K50}花{\K50}にな{\K80}る　{\K20\K30}毒{\K10}の{\K10}実{\K10}に{\K60}も{\K60}なる
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:55.80,0:01:00.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}今日{\K60}も{\K120}雨　{\K40\K40}あの{\K120}日と今{\K40}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:01.00,0:01:04.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}空{\K30}と{\K30}空{\K30}で{\K30}つ{\K60}なぎ{\K80}た{\K30}い{\K60}の
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:05.30,0:01:08.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K20}In {\K30}this {\K60}Craziness,{\K30\K90}Uncertainty
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:08.30,0:01:10.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}一人{\K60}一人{\K40}の{\K60}思{\K30}い{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:11.10,0:01:15.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}か{\K50}に{\K40}残{\K40}せる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:16.20,0:01:18.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K20}In {\K30}this {\K60}Craziness,{\K20\K40}You {\K40}gave me {\K20}life
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:18.70,0:01:21.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K160}ひとつの{\K60}思{\K30}い{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:21.60,0:01:26.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}ま{\K50}で{\K40}守{\K40}れる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:27.20,0:01:29.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K5}In {\K20}this {\K50}Craziness,{\K30\K90}Uncertainty
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:29.60,0:01:32.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}一人{\K60}一人{\K40}の{\K60}形{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:32.40,0:01:37.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}か{\K50}に{\K40}残{\K40}せる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:37.90,0:01:40.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K5}In {\K10}this {\K50}Craziness,{\K20\K40}You {\K40}gave me {\K20}life
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:40.40,0:01:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K140}それぞれの{\K60}形{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:43.20,0:01:48.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}ま{\K50}で{\K40}守{\K40}れる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:24.55,0:02:29.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H0000FF&}零落的碎片
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:33.00,0:02:33.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,澤井
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:34.40,0:02:35.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,澤井
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:36.80,0:02:39.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,澤井 不去學校嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:39.20,0:02:40.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家很擔心啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:41.20,0:02:42.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能不能說句話啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:44.70,0:02:47.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不說話也找不到解決的方法啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:48.80,0:02:50.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吧 澤井
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:51.40,0:02:52.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,澤井
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:52.60,0:02:53.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老師
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:54.50,0:02:56.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天就差不多這樣吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:56.90,0:02:57.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:58.00,0:03:00.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她真是因爲身體不舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:03.30,0:03:06.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,澤井 老師明天還會來的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:07.60,0:03:09.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼 告辭了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:26.10,0:03:28.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到了很好的地方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:28.80,0:03:31.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,圖象上傳到留言版上了 請看看吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:47.80,0:03:49.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的很不錯呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:49.70,0:03:50.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想去看看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:51.70,0:03:54.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天也沒去學校
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:54.60,0:03:58.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老師也沒能體會到我的心情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:59.20,0:04:01.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我如何也沒法喜歡上老師
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:03.10,0:04:05.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道他爲什麼要對我那樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:06.70,0:04:07.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感覺不舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:08.90,0:04:12.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,銀蓮花
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:08.90,0:04:12.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fs18}銀蓮花花語是淒涼與寂寞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:19.40,0:04:20.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我說 澤井
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:21.10,0:04:22.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是見個面可以麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:23.30,0:04:24.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,澤井
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:24.80,0:04:27.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老師他也有自己的苦衷
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:29.10,0:04:31.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那地方我放學回家經常路過
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:32.40,0:04:33.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,心情也會平靜下來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:34.80,0:04:37.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在現實生活中 這些事情我沒告訴過任何人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:37.90,0:04:40.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我和銀蓮花之間的祕密
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:40.80,0:04:42.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兩個人的祕密
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:43.10,0:04:44.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,絕對的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:48.40,0:04:51.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,澤井 讓我聽聽你的聲音也好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:51.30,0:04:53.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,澤井 澤井
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:51.90,0:04:53.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可思議啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:54.00,0:04:57.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那樣的地方竟然可以讓心情平靜
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:57.40,0:04:58.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也好想去看看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:00.30,0:05:03.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近 家裏似乎也沒有容身之地
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:07.30,0:05:09.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,澤井 澤井
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:10.30,0:05:14.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,現在 正在那個廢墟的庭院中給你發郵件
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:15.00,0:05:17.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在學校裏遇到不順心的事 感到很沮喪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:18.60,0:05:21.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明天也不會去學校吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:25.00,0:05:27.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道地獄通信嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:27.90,0:05:29.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,澤井 澤井
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:29.90,0:05:31.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聽說過
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:31.70,0:05:33.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把怨恨的對象的名字寫上
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:34.20,0:05:37.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄少女就會爲你消除怨恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:45.30,0:05:47.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今夜我終於找到了網站
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:47.60,0:05:51.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在猶豫要不要寫上老師的名字
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:54.90,0:05:55.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,澤井
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:57.30,0:06:00.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,寫上去也沒什麼不好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:12.60,0:06:14.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你同情老師嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:16.20,0:06:21.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老師說不定也希望這樣的事發生呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:43.70,0:06:44.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呼喚我嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:54.00,0:06:57.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呀 像我這種人不知道能不能幫上忙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:58.10,0:07:02.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,柏木老師說你是個很熱心的老師呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:02.90,0:07:05.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,熱心不代表有能力啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:06.10,0:07:07.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我認爲並非如此
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:10.40,0:07:11.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是這裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:16.10,0:07:17.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 大家 安靜一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:19.80,0:07:22.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這位是記者柴田先生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:22.60,0:07:26.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天爲了採訪一些教育問題將旁聽我們的課
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:27.00,0:07:28.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,並問一些問題
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:28.90,0:07:31.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家要好好配合柴田先生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:31.60,0:07:32.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:34.30,0:07:35.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:42.60,0:07:44.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個 我是柴田一
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:45.00,0:07:48.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望我不會打擾大家上課 請多關…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:50.00,0:07:51.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了好了 安靜一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:05.20,0:08:07.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害人終害己
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:13.50,0:08:14.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:16.30,0:08:19.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了 愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:21.00,0:08:22.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:22.50,0:08:23.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒什麼的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:29.90,0:08:31.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都很老實呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:33.90,0:08:36.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真得覺得大家和普通學生沒什麼兩樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:36.70,0:08:38.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早上明明話那麼多
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:38.70,0:08:40.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個是交際吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:41.00,0:08:41.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,交際
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:42.30,0:08:42.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:43.50,0:08:48.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也就是朋友來搭話的時候就回幾句
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:49.10,0:08:51.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是那時候老師正在說話啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:51.60,0:08:55.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因爲老師是大人了 所以我們認爲沒有關係吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:55.90,0:08:57.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我們只是孩子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:57.60,0:09:00.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是乖乖地聽老師的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:00.50,0:09:02.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之後不知道要被別人說什麼閒話呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:04.80,0:09:06.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣好嗎 老師
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:06.70,0:09:10.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還好啦 最近的孩子都是這個樣子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:12.80,0:09:17.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,話說回來 你們有聽說過地獄通信嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:19.10,0:09:20.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倒是聽過…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:20.70,0:09:21.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是傳言吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:22.10,0:09:24.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搜索了也沒找到過
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:24.80,0:09:27.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聽說過有人登錄上嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:30.00,0:09:32.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家壓力都很大
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:34.30,0:09:38.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管誰都想詛咒那麼一兩個人吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:39.10,0:09:41.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以那種傳言纔會流傳開來的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:43.30,0:09:46.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,基本上他們都是好孩子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:46.90,0:09:48.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也別說大話了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:49.90,0:09:50.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:57.80,0:10:01.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老師也知道地獄通信嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:02.40,0:10:04.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個雖然聽到過一兩句
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:05.60,0:10:07.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有去登錄過嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:08.00,0:10:09.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼這麼問
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:10.20,0:10:14.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想老師可能也有想要詛咒的一兩個人吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:15.30,0:10:19.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,柴田先生 真正的取材目的不會是這個吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:19.90,0:10:21.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 沒那回事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:22.40,0:10:24.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要詛咒的人啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:25.10,0:10:27.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那情況或許正相反吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:33.70,0:10:35.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常感謝 那麼我…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:35.20,0:10:36.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,深澤老師
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:36.50,0:10:41.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老師 聽說你班上的澤井還沒有來上學啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:41.40,0:10:44.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這可不好辦啊 如果不好好教導的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:44.90,0:10:45.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:46.00,0:10:47.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算是去保健室躺着也好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:47.90,0:10:49.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那樣也算是來上學了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:49.90,0:10:51.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不來可是很麻煩的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:52.00,0:10:54.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,關係到學校的信譽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:55.20,0:10:57.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乾脆讓她退學算了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:01.00,0:11:03.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒成果啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:11.50,0:11:12.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,茜
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:36.60,0:11:40.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管是誰 都生活在事與願違的人生中
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:41.00,0:11:43.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然而像你這個年齡更是如此
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:44.30,0:11:47.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能一直這樣下去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:47.70,0:11:49.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個你也明白吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:51.80,0:11:52.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到學校來吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:53.10,0:11:54.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來的話會輕鬆一點的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:55.60,0:11:58.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至今我也一直在考慮你煩惱些什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:58.90,0:12:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是這麼回事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:00.80,0:12:04.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,現實上 一開始你不是也過得很開心嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:06.80,0:12:08.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請說點什麼吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:08.70,0:12:10.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不說我就什麼也不知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:13.40,0:12:14.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算說了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:16.10,0:12:18.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算說了 你也不會了解
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:19.10,0:12:19.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:20.20,0:12:24.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像老師這樣沒有任何疑問 認真工作的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:24.90,0:12:26.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,過着普通人的生活的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:27.40,0:12:29.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的心情你也不會了解
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:31.80,0:12:34.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,教室中的人際關係很複雜
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:35.40,0:12:37.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算知道是我不對
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:37.30,0:12:38.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也必須這麼做
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:38.60,0:12:39.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算知道那麼做不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:40.10,0:12:41.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也必須迎合
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:41.90,0:12:43.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣反覆着
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:43.40,0:12:44.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我討厭這樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:45.30,0:12:47.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你根本沒想到過吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:48.00,0:12:50.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,認爲大家只是喜歡這樣才這樣做的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:51.80,0:12:53.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看上去開心也是表面現象
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:54.30,0:12:56.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以才說老師不瞭解
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:00.20,0:13:01.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請不要再管我了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:02.10,0:13:04.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼要把我的事放在心上
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:05.50,0:13:10.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老師 如果我不去學校你會很爲難吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:10.90,0:13:12.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,班上有不去上學的學生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:13.00,0:13:15.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己的處境就很爲難 所以…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:15.20,0:13:16.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,認爲自己很瞭解吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:17.20,0:13:19.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要以爲自己是特殊的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:22.20,0:13:23.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:30.50,0:13:31.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正如你所說的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:32.70,0:13:34.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我並沒有考慮到你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:34.50,0:13:36.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只考慮自己的處境
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:37.00,0:13:38.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天我來這裏也是因爲
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:38.90,0:13:41.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,教導主任催着我解決你的事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:42.60,0:13:45.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,面子啊 全是面子問題
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:48.70,0:13:49.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,剛纔那樣說話 不好意思
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:51.70,0:13:52.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我還會再來的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:53.10,0:13:56.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可不能讓媽媽太擔心啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:07.40,0:14:11.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道該如何是好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:13.30,0:14:16.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是自己不好 還是周圍的人不好呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:17.40,0:14:18.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:20.40,0:14:21.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,實在是偶然
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:22.50,0:14:25.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也在想着同樣的事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:25.90,0:14:28.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道該怎麼辦好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:28.50,0:14:32.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,索性真的就不再去學校了呢 還是去呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:04.50,0:15:05.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大喫一驚啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:06.00,0:15:08.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,勸你來學校那麼多次的明明是我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:09.30,0:15:12.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒想到你來了卻反而變得有些不安了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:13.10,0:15:14.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是個傻瓜
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:16.60,0:15:18.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了 發生什麼事了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:20.50,0:15:21.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己也不…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:22.60,0:15:24.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道怎麼做好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:25.10,0:15:25.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:28.30,0:15:31.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨天 老師坦白了自己的心情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:32.20,0:15:35.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還有 對不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:39.00,0:15:40.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,深澤老師
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:41.10,0:15:42.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,稍等一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:48.20,0:15:51.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你猜我現在在哪裏啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:52.40,0:15:53.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是在學校
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:53.90,0:15:55.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己都無法相信
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:56.40,0:15:59.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回家以後再發郵件吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:37.70,0:16:38.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幹什麼呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:41.20,0:16:42.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早就知道了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:43.40,0:16:47.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道我是銀蓮花纔跟我發郵件的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:49.50,0:16:50.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼回事啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:50.90,0:16:52.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等 請等一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:52.80,0:16:53.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼回事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:54.10,0:16:55.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是的 不是那樣的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:57.70,0:16:58.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是那樣的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:04.40,0:17:05.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大喫一驚啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:05.90,0:17:07.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,銀蓮花竟然就是澤井
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:08.50,0:17:10.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒有想要欺騙你的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:10.50,0:17:11.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原諒我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:13.80,0:17:15.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我沒有其他發泄的方法
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:16.50,0:17:19.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果什麼都不做早就承受不了了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:20.40,0:17:24.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖然學生時期不明白不上學的人的心情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:24.80,0:17:27.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,當上教師後開始理解了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:28.40,0:17:29.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是諷刺
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:31.00,0:17:34.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 和老師交流才讓我解脫了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:35.90,0:17:36.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:37.70,0:17:43.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起 我在地獄通信上寫了老師的名字
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:44.00,0:17:45.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,遇到了嗎 地獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:48.60,0:17:49.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎樣的女孩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:50.70,0:17:54.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,總覺得是個非常寂寞的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:55.70,0:17:56.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:59.20,0:18:01.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也想見見她啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:06.50,0:18:09.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能把我送進地獄去嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:11.10,0:18:12.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,疲憊了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:12.60,0:18:13.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想輕鬆一點
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:15.10,0:18:17.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已經厭倦了一切
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:20.60,0:18:21.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜託了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:34.10,0:18:37.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你若真的要消除怨恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:38.60,0:18:40.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,將這紅線解開即可
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:43.70,0:18:44.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:45.10,0:18:46.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨恨若已消除
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:47.00,0:18:49.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自己亦將付出代價
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:51.50,0:18:54.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害人終害己
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:56.40,0:18:58.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,深澤好像有些不正常呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:58.80,0:19:02.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也許是因爲想裝聰明而導致有點失常吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:02.30,0:19:04.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不想見到他
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:11.30,0:19:12.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,締結契約後
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:13.60,0:19:16.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的靈魂亦將墜入地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:18.60,0:19:20.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以要怎麼說才明白啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:20.80,0:19:22.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖說是幫助學生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:22.20,0:19:25.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是提高不了升學率又有什麼前途可言
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:25.80,0:19:27.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,總是跟差生來往
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:27.60,0:19:29.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,現在全班成績
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:40.70,0:19:43.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之後的事 就由你自己抉擇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:52.30,0:19:54.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨 恨 已 聞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:12.70,0:20:13.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:14.30,0:20:16.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣就能去地獄了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:17.20,0:20:18.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒錯吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:19.60,0:20:24.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老師 可知道自己的所做意味着什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:26.10,0:20:26.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:29.40,0:20:30.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,澤井
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:31.00,0:20:35.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和我締結了契約的人無法前往極樂淨土
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:36.20,0:20:40.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死後 其靈魂將飽嘗痛楚與苦難
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:40.90,0:20:42.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永遠徘徊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:43.80,0:20:45.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:46.10,0:20:48.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是因爲你自作聰明
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:49.70,0:20:51.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想去地獄遊山玩水嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:53.20,0:20:55.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼會 澤井
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:57.80,0:21:02.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老師 我之後也會去那的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:03.10,0:21:06.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請等着我 在地獄的深淵中
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:08.00,0:21:08.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,澤井
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:15.50,0:21:16.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,此怨此恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:17.80,0:21:19.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,將流向地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:31.10,0:21:34.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,失蹤了 深澤老師
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:34.20,0:21:37.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 是個熱心的老師啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:37.50,0:21:39.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能是認真過頭了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:39.90,0:21:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望他別一時衝動做了什麼錯事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:51.60,0:21:52.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:52.80,0:21:55.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人類還是難以理解啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:55.70,0:21:58.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個熱血老師失蹤了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:59.10,0:22:00.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這麼認真的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:01.00,0:22:02.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然現在的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:03.80,0:22:04.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:05.70,0:22:08.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒事吧 鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:08.40,0:22:10.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣好嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:10.90,0:22:13.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把地獄當作極樂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:17.30,0:22:20.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣就可以了啊 愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:20.70,0:22:24.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本人說好那就可以了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:24.50,0:22:28.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,後事你不必去考慮
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:32.20,0:22:33.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:37.10,0:22:38.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可思議啊
